<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Winterthur shares.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Winterthur shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unoin Bank of Switzerland, Zurich</p>
<p>said it has issued 50 million American-style call warrants, on</p>
<p>Winterthur shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1600 CHF		  PREMIUM	23.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.26 CHF		  GEARING	11.1 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	31.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1400 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
